  "description": "A Korean web manhwa featuring the Avengers on an adventure in Korea. It introduced the character of White Fox\n\nA building inexplicably animates in Seoul, catching the attention of local superhero White Fox. Meanwhile, Hawkeye goes missing on a solo mission to an island in the Yellow Sea. And the rain in Seoul simply won't stop. The Avengers are bound for South Korea, and they're going to find trouble when they get there.\n\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%96%B4%EB%B2%A4%EC%A0%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EC%9D%BC%EB%A0%89%ED%8A%B8%EB%A6%AD-%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B8/1138)",
